   Hou, Rui; Jiang, Cong; Zheng, Qian; Wang, Chenfang; Xu, Jin-Rong, Northwest Agr \& Forestry Univ, Coll Plant Protect, State Key Lab Crop Stress Biol Arid Areas, Yangling 712100, Shaanxi, Peoples R China.
   Hou, Rui; Zheng, Qian; Xu, Jin-Rong, Purdue Univ, Dept Bot \& Plant Pathol, W Lafayette, IN 47907 USA.},
DOI = {10.1111/mpp.12254},
